---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify leading-relaxed">
    Passionate and adaptable <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Software Engineer</span> with a strong drive to learn and apply diverse technologies. Built and deployed a pick-up basketball platform in South Korea using <span class="text-accent font-semibold">React</span>, <span class="text-secondary font-semibold">Vite.js</span>, and <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Express</span> (<a href="https://hoopsterz.vercel.app" target="_blank" class="link">Hoopsterz</a>). Led development of the <span class="text-primary font-semibold">UCLA Korean website</span> using <span class="text-secondary font-semibold">React</span> and <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Firebase</span>, connecting <span class="font-semibold">500+ students</span> and organizations. Created a <span class="text-primary font-semibold">3D RPG game</span> in <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Unity</span> with <span class="text-secondary font-semibold">C#</span>, and built cross-platform web and mobile apps using <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Flutter (Dart)</span> and a <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Prisma</span> backend during HackSC. Eager to deliver scalable, user-focused solutions through continuous learning.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Contact</div>
  </div>
  <div class="mb-10 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <div class="text-sm opacity-70">Name</div>
      <div class="font-medium">Seoungmin Kim</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="text-sm opacity-70">Location</div>
      <div class="font-medium">729 Gayley Ave, Los Angeles, CA</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="text-sm opacity-70">Mobile</div>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary normal-case" href="tel:+12139022955">+1 213-902-2955</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="text-sm opacity-70">Email</div>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-secondary normal-case" href="mailto:seoungminics@gmail.com">seoungminics@gmail.com</a>
    </div>
    <div class="sm:col-span-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-accent normal-case" href="https://github.com/EricSeoungminKim" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary normal-case" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/seoungmin-kim-400597222/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary normal-case" href="https://devpost.com/EricSeoungminKim?ref_content=user-portfolio&ref_feature=portfolio&ref_medium=global-nav" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Devpost</a>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline normal-case" href="https://hoopsterz.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hoopsterz</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.S. in Electrical Engineering"
      subtitle="Expected Graduation: June 2027 @ University of California, Los Angeles"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Chief Technology Officer / Project Manager — Hoopsterz Corp."
      subtitle="Full-Stack Development • May 2023 - December 2023 • Start-Up, Seoul, South Korea"
    >
      Engineered high-performance web applications using <span class="text-secondary font-medium">Vite</span> and <span class="text-accent font-medium">React.js</span>, boosting user engagement by <span class="text-primary font-semibold">30%</span> with optimized <span class="text-primary font-medium">Express.js</span> backend. Used server-side infrastructure and <span class="text-accent font-medium">MongoDB</span> database.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Lead Developer — UCLA Korean Website"
      subtitle="UCLA, CA, USA • Oct 2022 - Apr 2023"
    >
      Led development of the <span class="text-primary font-medium">UCLA Korean website</span>, integrating information from multiple Korean clubs through a user-friendly interface, boosting engagement by connecting <span class="font-semibold">500+ members</span> using a <span class="text-accent font-medium">Firebase</span> backend and <span class="text-secondary font-medium">React.js</span> frontend.
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Programmer — 3D RPG game: Xinshen (ACM Studio)"
      subtitle="UCLA, CA, USA • Jan 2023 - Jun 2023"
    >
      Developed <span class="text-primary font-medium">Xinshen</span>, a 3D RPG game using <span class="text-accent font-medium">C#</span> and <span class="text-secondary font-medium">Unity</span>, featuring multiple levels and engaging character designs. Applied object-oriented programming principles in <span class="font-medium">C#</span> for gameplay logic.
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Awards</div>
  </div>
  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li><span class="badge badge-accent badge-outline mr-2">HackSC</span> 1st Place in Global Connections Vertical</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">JavaScript</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">React.js</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Vite.js</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Node.js</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Express.js</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Prisma</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">RESTful APIs</span><span class="text-sm">8 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-primary w-full" value="80" max="100"></progress>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-2">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Python</span><span class="text-sm">7 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-accent w-full" value="70" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">C++</span><span class="text-sm">7 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-accent w-full" value="70" max="100"></progress>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-2">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">Dart / Flutter</span><span class="text-sm">5 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-secondary w-full" value="50" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="font-medium">C#</span><span class="text-sm">5 / 10</span></div>
      <progress class="progress progress-secondary w-full" value="50" max="100"></progress>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Languages</div>
  </div>
  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>Korean (Native)</li>
    <li>English (Native)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-6 border-b border-base-300 pb-2">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold tracking-wide">Projects & Links</div>
  </div>
  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a class="link link-accent" href="https://hoopsterz.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hoopsterz — Pick-up basketball platform</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="link" href="https://github.com/EricSeoungminKim" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub — Projects and code</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/seoungmin-kim-400597222/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn — Profile</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="link" href="https://devpost.com/EricSeoungminKim?ref_content=user-portfolio&ref_feature=portfolio&ref_medium=global-nav" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Devpost — Hackathon portfolio</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
